        "Content": "Comfortable spacious double en- suite bedroom newly decorated and renovated in a peaceful quiet bucolic area,  kitchen fitted out with cooker, hob,washing machine , kettle ,toaster, pots n pans ,delph, cutlery,  central heating , TV multiple channels ,free WiFi , lots of free parking as a car is essential , garden front and rear... 5 mins from train to Dublin /Westport ,Citylink service to Dublin airport  Galway,Sligo,Castlebar, Westport,\nKnock airport 25mins .No smoking or pets allowed ."
